{"index":8,"kind":"p","text":"因此，方程组（1）有两个解：\n$(-8,6)$和$(6,-8)$.","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":41,"source_refs":["p0048#6"],"changes":["layout"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}
{"index":9,"kind":"p","text":"现在我们不用图解法来解同一个方程组.","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":41,"source_refs":["p0048#7"],"changes":[],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}
{"index":10,"kind":"p","text":"在第二个方程中，用变量$y$表示变量$x$后，得到：\n$x=-2-y$.","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":41,"source_refs":["p0048#8"],"changes":["layout"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}
{"index":11,"kind":"p","text":"把表示式$-2-y$代入第一个方程替换变量$x$：\n$\\begin{cases}(-2-y)^2+y^2=100,\\\\x=-2-y.\\end{cases}$","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":42,"source_refs":["p0049#1"],"changes":["layout"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}
{"index":12,"kind":"p","text":"由方程$(-2-y)^2+y^2=100$求得$y=-8$或$y=6$.","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":42,"source_refs":["p0049#2"],"changes":[],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}
{"index":13,"kind":"p","text":"因此方程组（1）和下列命题等价：\n$\\begin{cases}x=-2-y,\\\\y=-8\\end{cases}$或$\\begin{cases}x=-2-y,\\\\y=6.\\end{cases}$","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":42,"source_refs":["p0049#3"],"changes":["layout"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}
{"index":14,"kind":"p","text":"由此得$\\begin{cases}x=6,\\\\y=-8\\end{cases}$。\n或$\\begin{cases}x=-8,\\\\y=6.\\end{cases}$","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":42,"source_refs":["p0049#4"],"changes":["layout"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}
{"index":15,"kind":"p","text":"答：\n$\\{(6,-8),(-8,6)\\}$.","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":42,"source_refs":["p0049#5"],"changes":["layout"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}
