{"index":19,"kind":"p","text":"在一次方程$x+2y=1$中，用$y$表示变量$x$并把表示式$1-2y$代入方程组的第一个方程替换$x$后，得到和原方程组同解的方程组：\n$\\begin{cases}(1-2y)^2-3(1-2y)y-2y^2+5(1-2y)-7y+10=0,\\\\x=1-2y.\\end{cases}$","id":null,"label":null,"printed_page":42,"source_refs":["p0049#9","p0050#1"],"changes":["layout"],"numeric_changes":[],"historical_entities":[]}
